    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">I'm With Stupid (I mean Cupid)</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;Catra's been sent to Adora to help her find her true love.&lt;br&gt;
And who would be the best cupid to send to the blonde than Catra.&lt;br&gt;
A magicat that's too good at her job.&lt;br&gt;
But things don't go to plan when she finds herself falling for Adora.&lt;br&gt;
And that's against the rules.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Will Adora find her true love or will Catra defy the rules?&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
